msgid "Microsoft refused the sign-in"
msgstr "Microsoft je zavrnil prijavo"

#: src/features/migrations/text.ts
msgid "Microsoft signed you in, but the mailbox refused the token: usually IMAP is turned off for it. Ask your admin to turn it on in the Microsoft 365 admin center › Users › Active users › the mailbox › Mail › Manage email apps, then sign in again."
msgstr "Microsoft vas je prijavil, vendar je nabiralnik žeton zavrnil: običajno je zanj IMAP izklopljen. Prosite skrbnika, naj ga vklopi v skrbniškem centru Microsoft 365 › Uporabniki › Aktivni uporabniki › nabiralnik › Pošta › Upravljanje e-poštnih aplikacij, nato se prijavite znova."

#: src/features/migrations/SignInConnectStep.tsx
msgid "Microsoft stopped accepting Yuva's sign-in. Sign in with Microsoft again as {address}; the migration continues where it stopped."
msgstr "Microsoft je prenehal sprejemati prijavo Yuve. Znova se prijavite z Microsoftom kot {address}; selitev se nadaljuje tam, kjer se je ustavila."

#: src/features/migrations/text.ts
msgid "Microsoft wants your consent again"
msgstr "Microsoft želi znova vaše soglasje"

#: src/features/migrations/SignInConnectStep.tsx
msgid "Microsoft's consent page asks you to allow “Read and write access to mailboxes via IMAP”, because Microsoft has no read-only IMAP permission. Yuva still only reads: its connection refuses every command that could delete, move or mark mail, and Yuva deletes its token when the migration ends."
msgstr "Stran za soglasje Microsofta vas prosi za dovoljenje »Dostop za branje in pisanje do nabiralnikov prek IMAP«, ker Microsoft nima dovoljenja IMAP samo za branje. Yuva še vedno samo bere: njena povezava zavrne vsak ukaz, ki bi lahko izbrisal, premaknil ali označil pošto, in Yuva svoj žeton izbriše, ko se selitev konča."

#: src/features/migrations/text.ts
msgid "Microsoft's token grants more than reading mail over IMAP, so Yuva does not use it. Check the app's API permissions, then sign in again."
msgstr "Žeton Microsofta dodeljuje več kot branje pošte prek IMAP, zato ga Yuva ne uporabi. Preverite dovoljenja API aplikacije in se nato prijavite znova."

